Adapted parts (app/src/main/java/com/monotonnoe/oneglass/glass/GlassShader.java):
  - rounded-rectangle SDF gradient (gradSdRoundedRect) used for smooth normals,
  - lens refraction with circle-map profile and depth effect,
  - 7-tap chromatic dispersion,
  - vibrancy colour controls (saturation matrix),
  - directional highlight (|dot(normal, light)|^falloff, Plus blend).
The code was translated from Kotlin/Compose to Java/AGSL for use inside a
View-based launcher and modified (Figma layer stack, continuous corners).
